            <div xml:id="d88">

                <pb facs="0099" n="90" xml:id="pg90"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">340.1115A/604b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Italy</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-15T03:00:00-04:00">May 15, 1940—3
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>117. Please telegraph best estimate of the number of Americans who will leave
                    Italy following your warning and number for whom special arrangements may have
                    to be made should the Mediterranean be closed So American shipping.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
